use firn/tags

imagemagick is a Module
imagemagick is tagged cli-tools

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.imagemagick.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.imagemagick]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."imagemagick"."enable": enable "ImageMagick image processing"
